From: Folia Compatibility Patch
Subject: [PATCH 0007] ReallyFastBlockHandler: Migrate to GlobalRegionScheduler and AsyncScheduler

AE PATCH REASON: Bukkit scheduler incompatible with Folia plugin lifecycle
AE PATCH FIX: Migrate to GlobalRegionScheduler and AsyncScheduler
AE PATCH RISK: LOW
AE PATCH EXCLUDES: net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/ReallyFastBlockHandler.class, net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/ReallyFastBlockHandler$*.class

---
diff --git a/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/ReallyFastBlockHandler.java b/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/ReallyFastBlockHandler.java
index 1b3130e..4823dee 100644
